* Port to GTK 3 (or GTK 4). The code uses GTK 2.24 only through API that
  still exists in GTK 3, but GtkStatusIcon has no GTK 4 replacement.
* Port to libmpdclient; libmpd is unmaintained and needs polling, MPD's
  idle command would make the 300 ms status timer unnecessary.
* Fetch covers with MPD's albumart and readpicture commands once
  libmpdclient is used, so covers work without a local music directory.
* Translate the desktop file.
* Support markup for the current playlist.
* On closing gimmix, check whether the tray icon is visible; if not, quit
  instead of hiding the window. [suggested by qball]
